1.4173228346456694 w
0.31 0.27 0.9 RG
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 785.1970866141732586 Td
(Jane:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 785.1970866141732586 Td
(Yes, there are. There are four main types of Entries in the RM. They are Observation,) Tj
T* (Evaluation, Instruction, and Action.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 745.5120472440944468 Td
(Joe:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 745.5120472440944468 Td
(That sounds detailed. Can we talk about them one by one? What is an Observation?) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 720.0002362204724022 Td
(Jane:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 720.0002362204724022 Td
(Of course. An Observation is information that you can see, hear, or measure. It is) Tj
T* (objective. It is a fact about the present or the past.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 680.3151968503937042 Td
(Joe:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 680.3151968503937042 Td
(Can you give me an example of an Observation?) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 654.8033858267716596 Td
(Jane:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 654.8033858267716596 Td
(Yes. Imagine a nurse measures your temperature. The number on the thermometer is an) Tj
T* (Observation. If you tell the doctor, 'My leg hurts,' that is also an Observation. It is a) Tj
T* (symptom.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 600.9451181102361943 Td
(Joe:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 600.9451181102361943 Td
(I see. So, lab results are Observations too?) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 575.4333070866141497 Td
(Jane:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 575.4333070866141497 Td
(Correct. A blood test result is an Observation. Now, the second type is Evaluation. Do you) Tj
T* (know what evaluation means in general English?) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 535.748267716535338 Td
(Joe:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 535.748267716535338 Td
(It means to judge something, or to give an opinion.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 510.2364566929133503 Td
(Jane:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 510.2364566929133503 Td
(Perfect. In the openEHR RM, an Evaluation is the doctor's opinion. It is a diagnosis. It is) Tj
T* (what the doctor thinks about the Observations.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 470.5514173228345953 Td
(Joe:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 470.5514173228345953 Td
(So, if the Observation is 'high temperature', the Evaluation is 'You have the flu'?) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 445.0396062992125508 Td
(Jane:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 445.0396062992125508 Td
(That is a perfect example, Joe! The temperature is the fact. The flu diagnosis is the) Tj
T* (assessment. That is the Evaluation.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 405.3545669291337958 Td
(Joe:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 405.3545669291337958 Td
(Okay, that is clear. What is the third type?) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 379.8427559055117513 Td
(Jane:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 379.8427559055117513 Td
(The third type is Instruction. An Instruction is when the doctor tells someone to do) Tj
T* (something. It is about the future.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 340.1577165354329964 Td
(Joe:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 340.1577165354329964 Td
(Is it like a prescription?) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 314.6459055118109518 Td
(Jane:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 314.6459055118109518 Td
(Yes. A prescription for medicine is an Instruction. A referral to another doctor is an) Tj
T* (Instruction. It is a plan.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 274.9608661417322537 Td
(Joe:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 274.9608661417322537 Td
(Okay. And the last one is Action?) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 249.4490551181102092 Td
(Jane:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 249.4490551181102092 Td
(Yes, Action. An Action records what was done. It is linked to the Instruction.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 223.9372440944881646 Td
(Joe:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 223.9372440944881646 Td
(How is it linked?) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 198.4254330708660063 Td
(Jane:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 198.4254330708660063 Td
(Well, imagine the doctor creates an Instruction: 'Give patient an injection.' Later, the nurse) Tj
T* (gives the injection. The nurse records an Action: 'Injection given at 2 PM'.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 158.7403937007873083 Td
(Joe:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 158.7403937007873083 Td
(I understand. The Instruction is the plan, and the Action is the reality.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 133.2285826771652637 Td
(Jane:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 133.2285826771652637 Td
(Exactly. This helps us track the workflow. We know what was ordered and what was) Tj
T* (finished.) Tj
